<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="old-primary-loop"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="600" grid="1" gridSize="10" page="1" pageWidth="1000" pageHeight="560"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="a" value="1. Old primary starts as standby&lt;br&gt;standby.signal + primary_conninfo&lt;br&gt;pointing at the new primary" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="20" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="b" value="2. walreceiver connects&lt;br&gt;learns the primary is on timeline 2&lt;br&gt;fetches 00000002.history" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="20" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c" value="3. asks for timeline 1 WAL from the&lt;br&gt;start of its segment (0/3000000)&lt;br&gt;started streaming WAL ... timeline 1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="20" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="d" value="4. new primary: timeline 1 ends at the&lt;br&gt;fork point (from the history file)&lt;br&gt;End of WAL reached on timeline 1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="170" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e" value="5. startup process decides whether&lt;br&gt;to follow timeline 2: compares the&lt;br&gt;fork point with its recovery point" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="170" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="f" value="fork point &gt;= recovery point&lt;br&gt;no WAL beyond the fork&lt;br&gt;new target timeline is 2: it streams&lt;br&gt;from the new primary, normal standby" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="690" y="330" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="g" value="fork point &lt; recovery point&lt;br&gt;new timeline 2 forked off ... before&lt;br&gt;current recovery point (extra local WAL)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="330" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="h" value="6. automatic retry after 5 s&lt;br&gt;startup process is still on timeline 1,&lt;br&gt;so it requests timeline 1 again" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="330" width="290" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="i" value="Operator action, not automatic:&lt;br&gt;pg_rewind or re-clone (pg_basebackup)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="460" width="290" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="a" target="b"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="b" target="c"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c" target="d"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="d" target="e"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="yes" style="endArrow=block;html=1;rounded=0;edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;" edge="1" parent="1" source="e" target="f"><mxGeometry relative="1" 